The purpose of this role is to analyse the samples from external and internal customers according to the set standard operation procedures for the specific task.
DIVERSITY OF WORK
Works within analytical section at an interpretive level, however analytical function is part of the Laboratory.
DECISION MAKING
Open ended, production decisions or recommendations, requiring understanding of analytical processes.
MAJOR RESPONSIBILITIES
Ensure all samples are analyse to the specific standard operating procedure;
Ensure all relative sample information is entered correctly and efficiently into computer systems(LIMS,SAP);
Ensure that the correct preparation principles are applied before assaying and sampling Standards and principles;
Perform continuous control monitoring to ensure that processes are running smoothly;
Issue certificates for the samples when they are of the specified standard.
Requirements
