About The Job
The CSIR has a vacancy for a Research Group Leader in the Technology for Special Operations (TSO) impact area, within the Defence and Security cluster. The incumbent will be responsible for the provision of strategic and technical leadership to the Maritime Systems Special Operations research group, including people management, business development, financial sustainability and operations management. This position is based in Stellenbosch.
Key Responsibilities
