Report on breaking news stories from Pretoria’s courtrooms;
Interview and report on the experiences of victims and witnesses of crime;
Write quality news and feature articles, adhering to strict deadlines and News24’s style;
Adhere to the quality, style and content standards as laid out and required by the particular publication
Live reporting into News24 live blogs on developing stories;
Secure newsmakers for in-depth interviews on topical issues.
