Established network of contacts in Pretoria’s courts;
Strong command of English;
Solid understanding of the law and judicial processes in South Africa;
Able to work under pressure and to strict deadlines;
Good time management, the ability to multitask effectively and complete tasks timeously;
Sound news judgment;
Knowledge of the online news environment and digital publishing tools, including mobile video and photos;
Detail orientation;
Good people skills;
Quality orientation and the ability to deliver clean copy, and
Understanding of the SA Press Code and adherence to our code of ethics.
