Relevant tertiary qualification;
At least 7 years’ experience in court reporting in Pretoria;
Excellent general knowledge;
Insightful knowledge of Pretoria and the judicial system;
Insightful knowledge of the major crimes affecting South Africa;
Insightful knowledge of the workings of the criminal justice system;
Strong knowledge of topical issues and current affairs;
Demonstrable network of contacts in all levels of law enforcement and/or the courts
