Main Purpose of the Job
Named after its founder, Pam Golding, the Group has over 2500 real estate professionals globally and operates in both the residential and commercial sectors. It is the largest independent property services company in Southern Africa and this leadership position is even more dominant in the more elite residential property sector. We are looking for fully qualified agents who live in the Pinetown, Westville & Queensburgh areas.
The role is about the successful marketing and selling of property and continued growth of market share, whilst providing excellent customer service to ensure that the Pam Golding Properties brand ethos is upheld.
