Main Purpose of the Job
To provide and deliver exceptional marketing support and service to the Branch Agents and Branch Management through collaboration and alignment with the Regional Marketing structure. The scope of work may include co-ordinating ad-hoc project outputs ranging from content creation, design, video editing, social media management and reporting.
This is a branch-based position in the Southern Suburbs (Kenilworth) and reporting to the Cape Regional Marketing Manager.
