Role Summary
As a Channel Account Executive you will oversee expanding our presence within the medium-sized enterprise segment via channel resellers and system integrators in the territory, developing strong and meaningful relationship with them. Your primary focus will be on promoting Sophos’ products and services, supporting resellers and distributors in pipeline growth and development, pro-actively challenging them to perform in the best possible way.
The role can be based remotely within Gauteng province and will be hired via 3rd party.
