Previous experience in a field business role, focused on development of medium-sized enterprise market by managing partner network to maximize shared goals and business opportunities;
Business acumen and strong skills in developing territory and business plans;
Goal orientated with the ability to exceed targets and KPI’s;
Excellent communication and negotiation skills with the ability to identify needs and pains and to underline the value of Sophos product line;
